{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HT63AztPXPn4kBCi8AHSvf","type":"tool_result","content":"=== stage\n/stage\tany\trequired\tenum=[\"initial notification\",\"intermediate report\",\"final report\"]\t1.1 Type of submission\n\nNext:\n  metais schema <package> stage  — Prints the whole schema, with each field's description.\n  metais validate <package> --data <dir>  — Validates the inputs you gathered in a data directory against this schema.\n=== entity\n/entity\tobject\trequired\tadditionalProperties=false\tThe financial entity\n/entity/affected_entity_lei\tstring\toptional\tpattern=\"^[A-Z0-9]{18}[0-9]{2}$\"\t1.6 LEI code of the financial entity affected\n/entity/affected_entity_name\tstring\toptional\tminLength=1\t1.5 Name of the financial entity affected\n/entity/affected_entity_types\tarray\trequired\tminItems=1 uniqueItems=true\t1.4 Type of the affected financial entity\n/entity/affected_entity_types/*\tany\toptional\tenum=[\"credit institution\",\"payment institution\",\"exempted payment institution\",\"account information service provider\",\"electronic money institution\",\"exempted electronic money institution\",\"investment firm\",\"crypto-asset service provider\",\"issuer of asset-referenced tokens\",\"central securities depository\",\"central counterparty\",\"trading venue\",\"trade repository\",\"manager of alternative investment fund\",\"management company\",\"data reporting service provider\",\"insurance and reinsurance undertaking\",\"insurance intermediary, reinsurance intermediary and ancillary insurance intermediary\",\"institution for occupational retirement provision\",\"credit rating agency\",\"administrator of critical benchmarks\",\"crowdfunding service provider\",\"securitisation repository\"]\t-\n/entity/parent_undertaking_lei\tstring\toptional\tpattern=\"^[A-Z0-9]{18}[0-9]{2}$\"\t1.14 LEI code of the ultimate parent undertaking\n/entity/parent_undertaking_name\tstring\toptional\tminLength=1\t1.13 Name of the ultimate parent undertaking\n/entity/primary_contact_email\tstring\trequired\tformat=\"email\"\t1.8 Primary contact person email\n/entity/primary_contact_name\tstring\trequired\tminLength=1\t1.7 Primary contact person name\n/entity/primary_contact_telephone\tstring\trequired\tpattern=\"^\\\\+[0-9][0-9 ]{5,19}$\"\t1.9 Primary contact person telephone\n/entity/reporting_currency\tstring\trequired\tpattern=\"^[A-Z]{3}$\"\t1.15 Reporting currency\n/entity/second_contact_email\tstring\trequired\tformat=\"email\"\t1.11 Second contact person email\n/entity/second_contact_name\tstring\trequired\tminLength=1\t1.10 Second contact person name\n/entity/second_contact_telephone\tstring\trequired\tpattern=\"^\\\\+[0-9][0-9 ]{5,19}$\"\t1.12 Second contact person telephone\n/entity/submitting_entity_code\tstring\trequired\tminLength=1\t1.3 Identification code of the entity submitting the report\n/entity/submitting_entity_name\tstring\trequired\tminLength=1\t1.2 Name of the entity submitting the report\n/entity/affected_entity_lei\tany\trequired\t-\t-\twhen /entity matches {\"properties\":{\"affected_entity_name\":true},\"required\":[\"affected_entity_name\"]}\n/entity/parent_undertaking_lei\tany\trequired\t-\t-\twhen /entity matches {\"properties\":{\"parent_undertaking_name\":true},\"required\":[\"parent_undertaking_name\"]}\n\nNext:\n  metais schema <package> entity  — Prints the whole schema, with each field's description.\n  metais validate <package> --data <dir>  — Validates the inputs you gathered in a data directory against this schema.\n=== incident\n/incident\tobject\trequired\tadditionalProperties=false\tThe incident\n/incident/additional_root_causes\tarray\toptional\tminItems=1 uniqueItems=true\t4.3 Additional classification of root causes of the incident\n/incident/additional_root_causes/*\tany\toptional\tenum=[\"monitoring of policy adherence\",\"monitoring of third-party service providers\",\"monitoring and verification of remediation of vulnerabilities\",\"ide