ected\tstring\toptional\tminLength=1\t3.22 Classification criterion ‘Critical services affected’\n/incident/data_losses\tarray\toptional\tminItems=1 uniqueItems=true\t3.20 Materiality thresholds for the classification criterion ‘Data losses’\n/incident/data_losses/*\tany\toptional\tenum=[\"availability\",\"authenticity\",\"integrity\",\"confidentiality\"]\t-\n/incident/data_losses_description\tstring\toptional\tminLength=1\t3.21 Description of the data losses\n/incident/description\tstring\trequired\tminLength=1\t2.4 Description of the ICT-related incident\n/incident/detected_at\tstring\trequired\tformat=\"date-time\" pattern=\"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}Z$\"\t2.2 Date and time of detection of the ICT-related incident\n/incident/discovery\tany\trequired\tenum=[\"IT Security\",\"staff\",\"internal audit\",\"external audit\",\"clients\",\"financial counterparts\",\"third-party provider\",\"attacker\",\"monitoring systems\",\"authority/agency/ law enforcement body\",\"other\"]\t2.7 Discovery of the major ICT-related incident\n/incident/duration\tstring\toptional\tpattern=\"^[0-9]{2,3}:([01][0-9]|2[0-3]):[0-5][0-9]$\"\t3.15 Duration of the incident\n/incident/duration_figures_basis\tany\toptional\tenum=[\"Actual figures\",\"Estimates\",\"Actual figures and estimates\",\"No information available\"]\t3.17 Information on whether the numbers for duration and service downtime are actual or estimates\n/incident/economic_impact_threshold\tstring\toptional\tminLength=1\t4.12 Materiality threshold for the classification criterion ‘Economic impact’\n/incident/financial_counterparts_affected\tinteger\toptional\tminimum=0\t3.6 Number of financial counterparts affected\n/incident/financial_counterparts_affected_percentage\tnumber\toptional\tmaximum=100 minimum=0\t3.7 Percentage of financial counterparts affected\n/incident/financial_recoveries\tnumber\toptional\tminimum=0\t4.14 Amount of financial recoveries\n/incident/geographical_spread_countries\tarray\